msgid ""
"New secret generated. Click Save Settings to apply, then copy it into your "
"receiving service."
msgstr ""
"Nuevo secreto generado. Haz clic en Guardar configuración para aplicar, "
"luego cópialo en tu servicio de recepción."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:3710
msgid "Rotate"
msgstr "Rotar"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:3710
msgid "Generate"
msgstr "Generar"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:3717
msgid ""
"Verifies INBOUND requests to POST buddynext/v1/webhook/access, which is the "
"only thing this secret does. Outgoing webhooks are signed with the secret "
"you set on each endpoint under Outbound endpoints, not with this one - do "
"not copy this value into Slack or Zapier. Click Rotate for a new strong "
"secret, then Save; the old value stops working immediately, so update "
"whatever calls that endpoint. Left blank, the inbound endpoint refuses every "
"request."
msgstr ""
"Verifica las solicitudes ENTRANTES a POST buddynext/v1/webhook/access, que "
"es lo único que hace este secreto. Los webhooks salientes se firman con el "
"secreto que configuras en cada endpoint en Endpoints de salida, no con este; "
"no copies este valor en Slack ni en Zapier. Haz clic en Rotar para generar "
"un secreto nuevo y fuerte, y luego en Guardar; el valor anterior deja de "
"funcionar de inmediato, así que actualiza lo que llame a ese endpoint. Si se "
"deja en blanco, el endpoint de entrada rechaza todas las solicitudes."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:3719
msgid ""
"Verifies INBOUND requests to POST buddynext/v1/webhook/access, which is the "
"only thing this secret does. Outgoing webhooks are signed with the secret "
"you set on each endpoint under Outbound endpoints, not with this one - do "
"not copy this value into Slack or Zapier. Click Generate, then Save, and "
"give the value to whatever service calls that endpoint. Left blank, the "
"inbound endpoint refuses every request."
msgstr ""
"Verifica las solicitudes ENTRANTES a POST buddynext/v1/webhook/access, que "
"es lo único que hace este secreto. Los webhooks salientes se firman con el "
"secreto que configuras en cada endpoint en Endpoints de salida, no con este; "
"no copies este valor en Slack ni en Zapier. Haz clic en Generar y luego en "
"Guardar, y entrega el valor al servicio que llame a ese endpoint. Si se deja "
"en blanco, el endpoint de entrada rechaza todas las solicitudes."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:3769 includes/Admin/Settings.php:3907
#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:3932
msgid "Endpoint"
msgstr "Endpoint"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:3774
msgid ""
"POST JSON here. Sign \"{timestamp}.{body}\" with HMAC-SHA256 and the shared "
"secret, then send the timestamp in X-BuddyNext-Timestamp and the hex "
"signature in X-BuddyNext-Signature. Make and Zapier can do this with their "
"built-in functions."
msgstr ""
"Envía el JSON aquí mediante POST. Firma \"{timestamp}.{body}\" con HMAC-"
"SHA256 y la clave secreta compartida, y después envía la marca de tiempo en "
"X-BuddyNext-Timestamp y la firma hexadecimal en X-BuddyNext-Signature. Make "
"y Zapier pueden hacerlo con sus funciones integradas."

